Note to pinheads:  I realize this is net.sources, but tell me please where
net.binaries are.

What follows is the uuencode of the PDP-11 UNIX macro assembler.  The next
article should have the uuencode of linkr.  Both were
compiled on a V7 system and the binaries transfered to 4.1BSD where I have had
no problems running them, fortunately, as I had nothing to do with their earlier
incarnations and would have been lost if they hadn't worked.  I have been told
that they work okay on 4.2 also, so...  G'Luk!

